	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## Usage

Search workflows in the [Alfred Gallery](https://alfred.app/) via the `gallery` keyword.

![Searching for alfredapp workflows](images/about/gallery.png)

* &lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; Open workflow’s Gallery page.
* &lt;kbd&gt;⌃&lt;/kbd&gt; Show tags.
* &lt;kbd&gt;⌘&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; Install workflow.
* &lt;kbd&gt;⌥&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; Narrow search to creator’s name.
* &lt;kbd&gt;⇧&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; Paste link to workflow’s Gallery page.
* &lt;kbd&gt;⌘&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;Y&lt;/kbd&gt; [Quick Look](https://www.alfredapp.com/help/features/previews/) workflow’s Gallery page.

By default, workflow Gallery pages open in a webview. You can change this in the [Workflow’s Configuration](https://www.alfredapp.com/help/workflows/user-configuration/)

![Viewing gallery page in web view](images/about/webview.png)

* &lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; Install workflow.
* &lt;kbd&gt;⌘&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;O&lt;/kbd&gt; Open in web browser.</string>
